    "description": "During a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surprise_Round\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprise Round\">Surprise Round</a>, before combat begins, if you are not <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surprised\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprised\">Surprised</a> you can give up your <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Standard_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Standard Action\">Standard Action</a> to allow all non-<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surprised\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprised\">Surprised</a> allies within your line of sight to take an extra <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Action\">Move Action</a> during the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Surprise_Round\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprise Round\">Surprise Round</a>.<br><br>Allies can spend this <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Move_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Move Action\">Move Action</a> to instead reroll their <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Initiative\" title=\"Initiative\">Initiative</a> checks and take the better of the two results as a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Free_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Free Action\">Free Action</a> before combat begins.",
